黄河 (the Yellow River) — the Ink Chronicle demo

Every picture is drawn in code. The words are public-domain Tang verse about the river: 王之涣《登鹳雀楼》《凉州词》,
李白《将进酒》 (its opening lines), 刘禹锡《浪淘沙》. The river's places are named in order from its source; its length,
5,464 km, and its reaches (3,472 km upper, 1,206 km middle, 786 km lower) are the commonly cited figures.

